      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Uses:\n\n- Also for multiple projects \n- Can be repository specific to\nassociate towards a project\n- reading and reading documentation\nlist tracking \nthings like excel challanges or slowly\nslowly completing like sql excercisses.\n\n- Feature ownership and revisions\nevery so often to check in. Up to 3\ntimes then n longer need to check in\n\n-storage of credentials (locally of\nocurse in hashed code tet.)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "WD5Uuv030ecp5bogNTsGg",
      "originalText": "Uses:\n\n- Also for multiple projects \n- Can be repository specific to associate towards a project\n- reading and reading documentation list tracking \nthings like excel challanges or slowly slowly completing like sql excercisses.\n\n- Feature ownership and revisions every so often to check in. Up to 3 times then n longer need to check in\n\n-storage of credentials (locally of ocurse in hashed code tet.)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
